Data notice

The datasets under data/raw/ are published by Government of India agencies
(National Crime Records Bureau, Bureau of Police Research and Development,
International Institute for Population Sciences for NFHS-5, and the Office of
the Registrar General & Census Commissioner for Census 2011). They remain
subject to their publishers' own terms of use and are redistributed here solely
for reproducibility of the analysis. This licence does not grant rights over
those datasets beyond what their publishers permit.

Attribution for the analytical implementation is documented in README.md
(section "Credits & Acknowledgements") and must be preserved in derived works.
